  "question": {
    "text": "A particular force <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi></math>&nbsp;applied on a wire increases its length by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>. If we were to increase the wire's length by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>, then the applied force is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mi>F</mi></math>. What is the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math>?",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;[<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi></math> = Change in length, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi></math> = Original length] (where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Y</mi></math> is Young&#39;s modulus of elasticity)</p><p>Since&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Y</mi></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> remain same.<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8733;</mo><mi>l</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mi>F</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>F</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>F</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
